// primary-declaration is closed. co.lang.loader is listed in the Builtin Kinds
// table but the reference gives it no declaration form, so it cannot head a
// file-backed primary. Traits and mixins used to sit here too; both now have
// productions of their own, which is why this case names a kind that still does
// not.
_ co.lang.loader = {
    label co.lang.string;
}
